abstract: >
  A reusable and evolving library of governance-ready artifacts for DPI and AI systems,
  including risk matrices, tier bindings, control-surface mappings, Minimum Digital Kernel
  operational contracts, bounded delegation, inference traceability, correction propagation,
  inter-institutional admissibility, and evidence-backed remediation profiles.
